      "text": "US and South Korean forces conducted Exercise Freedom Flag 26-1 involving USAF, ROKAF, and US Marine Corps personnel. A separate US-ROK civil-military crisis response workshop at Camp Humphreys focused on humanitarian assistance and disaster preparedness coordination across USFK, Combined Forces Command, and inter-agency partners. Full article text was inaccessible (access denied/CloudFront blocks), but DVIDS headlines confirm the exercises occurred.",
