      "text": "Special Prosecutor Cho Eun-suk's team requested 30 years additional imprisonment for Yoon Suk-yeol at the Seoul Central District Court sentencing hearing, alleging he ordered drone flights over Pyongyang in October 2024 to provoke North Korea and thereby justify his December 3 martial law declaration. Prosecutors also sought 25 years for former Defense Minister Kim Yong-hyun. Yoon delivered a one-hour final statement in closed proceedings due to military secrets; his defense team characterized the prosecutors as failing to back 'speculation and delusion' with evidence and expressed confidence of acquittal. Yoon already serves a life sentence for insurrection (appealed). The alleged drone operation preceded the martial law declaration by approximately two months.",
